    <expertiseList>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/e8318d57d62349dd8ef42b0f316a6c02"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/94ced41cda9e4b70a0829196d2caafa4"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/a872e374339e434da497b8d9b91cfda1"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/e8318d57d62349dd8ef42b0f316a6c02","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Geotechnical Investigations"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/94ced41cda9e4b70a0829196d2caafa4","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Concrete Testing and Investigations"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/a872e374339e434da497b8d9b91cfda1","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Soil Testing and Investigations"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/474bab66a3dd482493b8d0b7274e4a9c","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/474bab66a3dd482493b8d0b7274e4a9c","content":"\u003cdiv class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe acquisition of a new and profoundly powerful particle size analyser marks a significant milestone in our commitment to excellence and innovation at Roadlab.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this mission in mind, we are thrilled to announce the latest addition to our laboratory equipment lineup: the Mastersizer 3000E from Malvern Panalytical. We are the only commercial facility with this capacity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/45rgxwe1/mastersizer-image-1.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe Mastersizer 3000E from Malvern Panalytical.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eWhat Is The Mastersizer 3000E?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Mastersizer 3000E is a state-of-the-art solution designed to deliver precise and reliable particle size measurements across a wide range of applications.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUtilizing laser diffraction technology, the Mastersizer 3000E offers unparalleled accuracy and repeatability, ensuring precise measurements even for complex sample matrices.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Mastersizer 3000E is capable of accurately analyzing particle sizes ranging from 10 nanometers to 1 millimeter.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith rapid measurement capabilities, the Mastersizer 3000E enables faster turnaround times without compromising accuracy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts automated features minimize manual intervention, reducing the risk of errors and increasing productivity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/4ypfuhlg/mastersizer-background.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/hvzfrolc/mastersizer-3.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eHow Will It Benefit Roadlab Clients?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAggregate Testing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn the field of aggregate testing, accurate particle size analysis is crucial for evaluating the quality and performance of construction materials. With the Mastersizer 3000E, we can much more precisely determine the particle size distribution of aggregates, helping our clients make informed decisions regarding material selection and optimization.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSoil Characterization\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn soil characterization efforts, understanding the particle size distribution is essential for assessing soil stability. By employing the Mastersizer 3000E, we can conduct thorough soil analysis with unmatched precision, providing valuable insights for environmental, engineering and construction projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuality Control\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn addition to specific applications, the Mastersizer 3000E will play a pivotal role in our quality control processes across various testing procedures. This instrument will enable us to maintain stringent quality standards and ensure compliance with regulatory requirements.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eOur Technical Journey\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"td-a-rec td-a-rec-id-content_inlineleft  td_uid_12_633d70de2eeea_rand td_block_template_1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"td-visible-desktop\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"beacon_1c824f1e1b\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 0px; visibility: hidden;\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px;\" src=\"https://ads-za.privatelabel.co.za/www/delivery/lg.php?bannerid=1428\u0026amp;campaignid=218\u0026amp;zoneid=32\u0026amp;loc=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.miningmx.com%2Fnews%2Fbase-metals%2F49235-vedanta-approves-r7bn-project-to-double-up-zinc-from-gamsberg-facilities-in-northern-cape%2F\u0026amp;referer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2F\u0026amp;cb=1c824f1e1b\" alt=\"\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy harnessing the capabilities of this advanced particle size analyzer, we are poised to deliver superior results and exceed the expectations of our clients across diverse industries.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe remain dedicated to pushing the boundaries of laboratory testing and setting new benchmarks for quality, accuracy, and customer satisfaction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay tuned as we continue to leverage cutting-edge technologies to drive positive impact and create unmatched value for our clients.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cem\u003e- Janco Potgieter, Group Technical Manager\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/vwmbvrbe/janco.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eInterested in our work?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eReach out to us.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>Roadlab is an accomplished supporter of over 400 construction companies and 60 consulting firms. Our particle size analysis capabilities enable us to support their aggregate, soils and quality control needs.</p>",
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": []
  }
}]]></Value>
